34,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The morning routine takes up to nine minutes. That is huge for my gaps.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"We are billed for area, not heads. Empty desks still cost us 41,000 yen a month.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The survey says daylight is the biggest complaint. The plan gives only four windows.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The printer row is nine decibels louder. My chair takes days to adjust properly.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The new joiners learned by overhearing. Last spring, close seats meant faster answers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we keep the same desks, do we save the re-run cost?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, yes, but we pay for the empty space. We need to fill it or move.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, if the window seats are limited, who gets them? That is the real fight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I don't care about the window. I care about the noise and the chair.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, if we sit close, we talk more. That is a benefit, not a cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, but if I have to set up for nine minutes, I lose my morning.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, the facilities quote is 6,200 yen per desk. Moving is expensive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, but the billing is for area. If we consolidate, we save money.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, consolidating might mean I sit near the printer. That is bad for me.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, maybe we can rotate? That way everyone gets a turn at the quiet spots.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
