60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A means I pick a desk every day. That is too much setup time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B means we move blocks. That triggers the 6,200 yen fee every time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Option C fixes the seats. We can assign the window seats fairly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option C lets me keep my chair settings. That is important for my back.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Option C might isolate people. Option B keeps us moving and talking.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if we choose C, we pay the fee once. Is that better?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, yes, but we still pay for the empty desks if we don't fill them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, if we choose B, we avoid the permanent disadvantage of bad seats.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, but B means I have to re-adjust my chair every few months.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, maybe we can keep the chairs with the people? No, that defeats the point.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I prefer C. It is stable. I can plan my mornings better.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I prefer C. It minimizes the number of times we pay the facilities fee.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I prefer C. We can explicitly assign the window seats to those who need them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shion,,I prefer C. It respects the physical comfort of the workstation.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I prefer B. It keeps the team connected and prevents cliques.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
